  "body": "Often sought and rarely found, this well cared for single level home offers comfort, an outstanding location, and low maintenance living - perfect for those looking to downsize without compromise.\r\n\r\nInside, you will find two generous bedrooms, including a master with its own tiled ensuite, a tiled family bathroom, and a spacious open plan living and dining area. Internal access to the garage adds everyday convenience, while the rear fenced and gated outdoor area is the perfect spot to relax and escape the summer heat. A raised vegetable garden, outdoor clothesline and tool shed add practicality.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in a top street, it sits just a short stroll from the beach (only a few houses from the beach access walkway) and close to local shops and cafes. This is an unmissable lifestyle opportunity. Essential viewing.\r\n\r\nView further details at www.domett.co.nz",
